        "v7_note": "2026-10-10: v7 replaces v5 before v5 started. (1) real_guidance_scale 3 -> 2: DMD used x_c + s(x_c - x_u) = effective guidance 4 while the teacher sampler and B0's distillation use 3 (run A over-sharpened, PSNR -0.42 dB). (2) Discriminator = per-token heads on detached fake-score blocks 6/12/18 (F trained by flow matching only), hinge loss. (3) Its noise level is tied to the exit step of the judged sample (final step at t=502: sigma 0.05-0.50); real and fake share sigma and noise. (4) Pairs: rollout window judged as a 16-frame clip without the student history; first window with the real history in both. (5) Adversarial gradient at the student output capped at 0.35 x DMD per term; 100 steps heads-only, then a 200-step ramp of the adversarial weight to 0.01. Everything else as cfdmd_B_gan_v5. HPC3 copy.",
